{"about_the_game":"Northern Qu\u00e9bec, 1970: A mining village is enveloped in a distorted reality by a mysterious mist\u2014the Brume. Step back into your role as Detective Carl Faubert, now tasked with uncovering the enigmatic origins of this disruptive force. Navigate the snow-swept landscapes and encounter stranded victims and survivors of a devastating avalanche. Your ultimate mission: to trace the dark secret behind the Brume and strive to eliminate it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><br>Explore the vast fictive land of Manastan in Northern Canada and fight your way through the village  - or what's left of it. Search for clues in wooden shacks, visit nearby locations on your trusty dog sled and navigate the surrounding lakes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1229020/extras/f840c9e4f0b036bbe220912592498694.avif?t=1697633991\" width=600 height=224 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Investigate</h2><br>Follow your clues and findings very carefully. Consult Carl Faulbert's Journal and put your detective skills to the test. Can you piece together the mystery behind the brume?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1229020/extras/6a9f038a9a0687e8c9b79300ce1ed939.avif?t=1697633991\" width=600 height=224 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2><br>The Brume is relentless: a bitter cold blizzard, dangerous wildlife and troubling nightmares. Prepare to survive against all odds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1229020/extras/7c7eb5eead6151adcd777c3ae5c36702.avif?t=1697633991\" width=600 height=224 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience</h2><br>A rich story unfolds with every step you take. Find and inspect objects, letters and documents, while an omniscient storyteller narrates your journey in Manastan.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1229020/extras/b5ea99f0ebb94ade6c9cb7464cbb9dca.avif?t=1697633991\" width=600 height=224 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"87baa3334909858f99389487290b6f1da5ce87a7.jpg","localized_name":"Marche!","name":"Marche!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1229020/87baa3334909858f99389487290b6f1da5ce87a7.jpg"},{"icon":"8f00dfb59497cdb2a6f51de7bbc25277571f5393.jpg","localized_name":"Journal of Hamilton Estates","name":"Journal of Hamilton Estates","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1229020/8f00dfb59497cdb2a6f51de7bbc25277571f5393.jpg"},{"icon":"520359e9c93d21751e7ed660627a78381e2c87b5.jpg","localized_name":"Journal of Leech Lake","name":"Journal of Leech Lake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1229020/520359e9c93d21751e7ed660627a78381e2c87b5.jpg"},{"icon":"abf03ba1564b52284be5dab7d1e8da2d1ab9d4b1.jpg","localized_name":"Journal of HMC","name":"Journal of HMC","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1229020/abf03ba1564b52284be5dab7d1e8da2d1ab9d4b1.jpg"},{"icon":"b844d623d4d7c9b78bdef176a1a69ea1f679c3c5.jpg","localized_name":"Journal of Eweewach Valley","name":"Journal of Eweewach Valley","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1229020/b844d623d4d7c9b78bdef176a1a69ea1f679c3c5.jpg"},{"icon":"2d8674b76907cfd03688b5163520ef53ba579c21.jpg","localized_name":"True Detective","name":"True Detective","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1229020/2d8674b76907cfd03688b5163520ef53ba579c21.jpg"},{"icon":"cdc11d2cfadaaa76e9ffe8a86609aee7239aa717.jpg","localized_name":"Inukshuk","name":"Inukshuk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1229020/cdc11d2cfadaaa76e9